Data
----
Camera imagery comes from the U.S. Geological Survey National Imagery Management
System (NIMS), https://api.waterdata.usgs.gov/docs/nims/. Gage height and field
measurements come from the USGS Water Data APIs, https://api.waterdata.usgs.gov/.
USGS-authored or produced data and information are in the U.S. public domain.
Waterline is not affiliated with or endorsed by the USGS.

